      "content": "the problem is there is no \"path forward\" though. everything is just... gone. i tried talking to a couple people but they just stare at the floor or change the subject immediately. it's like i'm a mistake that everyone has collectively decided to ignore. i can't go back to how things were before the fallout, and i can't move forward because there's nothing to move toward. it's just this heavy, permanent emptiness.",
